{"parentUuid":"6b0afb2e-26a2-4523-a9df-8092da0017f7","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're polishing Callisto's release PR and changelog for users; today I fixed a review finding on #483 and opened #485 so new projects don't get a false \"changed, not releasing\" warning. Next: review and merge #483 and #485.","timestamp":"2026-11-09T21:11:44.862Z","uuid":"b341faa6-7bbf-4246-926e-13276afa6abc","isMeta":false,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
