{"parentUuid":"7f9ab445-9a4b-4eee-92fe-05a56b7a0fc0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgt4f4YmVYwm5i5c63wPQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W8TPKpc4P4KCQzgD3NHfvS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr486.md","content":"## Summary\n\nThe 0.19.0 changelog had 13 entries, most of them fix-ups to release PR features that have not shipped yet, and several described how it works instead of what a user gets. This rewrites them as 7 entries, one per user-visible change, each saying what changed, why it helps and what to do.\n\n- Folded into their feature's entry and removed: the Breaking bump check, headline and heading fixes, the ecosystem label, the private-member fix, the group-member changelog and the preview path change.\n- `AGENTS.md` now asks for why it matters to the user, and says a fix to something not yet released gets no changeset.\n- Bumps are unchanged: still a minor release.\n\n## Verify\n\n- `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0.\n\nNot run: CI. #483 and #485 carry their own changesets in the same style.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":782,"cache_read_input_tokens":317372,"output_tokens":548,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":782,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":548,"cache_read_input_tokens":317372,"cache_creation_input_tokens":782,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":782},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"c