see**","-- Changes grouped under Major, Minor and Patch, each titled by its first line instead of its file name, with long notes folded away","+- Changes grouped under Major, Minor and Patch, each titled by its first line instead of its file name, with long notes collapsed into an expandable block"," - A \"Read before merging\" block listing `Breaking:` and `Action:` notes, a `Breaking:` note whose bump is too low, and packages that changed but are not in this release"," - Where merging will publish each package, with a warning if the release would be refused"," - Labels such as `callisto: ready`, `blocked` and `bump: minor`, so you can triage without opening the PR"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ed1f8502-e1c5-4060-ad2f-26456977a548","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-set","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"docs/changeset-set","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
