{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","hash":"d73808e4f0e2e806ff87159bbb38856da566d75df2bc13d536595beec71ca5f5","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The cold read got the main points right: what's new, why it matters and the upgrade action. It flagged three vague phrases, and I'm fixing them: \"refused\", \"released with its group\" and \"folded away\"."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NPsiHQMijHQY25Zu71JTb2","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-set/.changeset/release-pr-overview.md","old_string":"with long notes folded away","new_string":"with long notes collapsed into an expandable block"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X37vkBsnEcFEWsr4W4KtEA","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-set/.changeset/release-pr-overview.md","old_string":"with a warning if the release would be refused","new_string":"with a warning up front if the release would fail, so you find out before merging"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0193hePUJFYFh99XF42mmkg7","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-set/.changeset/changelog-grouped-layout.md","old_string":"- A package that only released with its group gets one line saying so","new_string":"- A package with no changes of its own, released only because its fixed or linked group was, gets one line saying so"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014GMjn6GTRfK9h4iZuVFiBZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A && git commit -S -q -m \"docs: clear up three vague phrases in the changesets\" && sh /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/verify.sh /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-set 2>&1 | grep -E \"PASS|FAIL\"","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":900000},