{"parentUuid":"f9a62364-d3cf-4642-a4e6-d8a48c0e1164","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtVcAxoFcjMqNA8in3fa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. #485's conflict is resolved and pushed, and the stale branches and worktrees are cleaned up.\n\n**#485:** I merged main into the branch, kept main's line that mentions #483's `pr` field, and added my clause about untagged packages. The merge commit is signed, and pre-push, lint, doc-check, test and `just workflow-contracts` all exit 0.\n\n**Where I wasn't careful**\n- **Overlap check:** I ran the pairwise check after pushing, saw the conflict and moved on. It should have happened before opening the parallel branches, and then one of the PRs would have waited or carried the doc fix.\n- **Leftovers:** I left merged and closed branches and worktrees around while opening new ones, which makes it harder to see what's live.\n- **Branches:** I also opened more parallel PRs than were needed at once. That is why the conflict happened.\n\n**Cleaned up now**\n- **Removed:** the worktrees and local branches for #481, #482 and #483, each after confirming its tip is in `origin/main`, plus the old local `docs/agents-verify` branch.\n- **#484:** I removed its worktree and local branch. The PR is closed and the commit is still on the remote branch, which is yours to delete.\n- **Still live:** only the main checkout, `changeset-set` (#486) and `unreleased-needs-tag` (#485).\n\n**One more to know about.** I created a worktree in the plugins repo at `~/projects/wisp-plugins/.claude/worktrees/layered-changesets` for the plugin work. It has no edits, and it's yours or the other agent's to use or delete.\n\n**How I'll work from here.** One open PR at a time unless you say otherwise, and an overlap check before pushing a second branch.\n\nneeds input: review #485 and #486."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1531,"cache_read_input_tokens":378055,"output_tokens":726,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":139},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1531,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":726,"cache_read_input_tokens":378055,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1531,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1531},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b71c9181-2f42-4a3b-bb8d-60d6ea13c811","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgtVcAfSruF4vvUBt56x3","requestRef":"1843a16e-2229-4d46-b691-ae9213151f52","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"93934c5f-fbde-4444-b245-ff8dcd51ae26","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:55:25.307Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
