{"parentUuid":"9920eb71-d797-430c-b67f-66ce4ca5ea44","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Concise","turnReminder":"Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ab8016d5-b5c9-4165-af99-6bbc8a899e09","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:24:09.757Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nConcise output style is active. Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","hash":"73802350b6c7cf3098e981a91a4ed27f206723ccb94f3366e075205418b47bda","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"With two PRs awaiting review I won't open a third. I'll keep looking for user-facing rough edges instead, with no PR. This pass is the mistakes a real user makes: a typo'd package, an empty `add`, a missing summary, and a release dry-run on a fresh repo."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G3g8WeMpwsjWh8ApyvQJNL","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/user_walk2.sh","content":"wt=/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag\ncd \"$wt\" || exit 1\ncargo build -q -p callisto-cli || exit 1\nbin=\"$wt/target/debug/callisto\"\nd=$(mktemp -d)\ncd \"$d\" || exit 1\ngit init -q -b main && git config user.email t@e.com && git config user.name T && git config commit.gpgsign false\nmkdir -p crates/app/src crates/lib/src packages/web\nprintf '[workspace]\\nmembers = [\"crates/app\", \"crates/lib\"]\\nresolver = \"2\"\\n' > Cargo.toml\nprintf '[package]\\nname = \"lib\"\\nversion = \"1.0.0\"\\nedition = \"2021\"\\n' > crates/lib/Cargo.toml\nprintf '[package]\\nname = \"app\"\\nversion = \"1.0.0\"\\nedition = \"2021\"\\n[dependencies]\\nlib = { path = \"../lib\", version = \"1.0.0\" }\\n' > crates/app/Cargo.toml\necho \"\" > crates/lib/src/lib.rs; echo \"fn main() {}\" > crates/app/src/main.rs\nprintf '{ \"name\": \"@acme/web\", \"version\": \"0.3.0\" }\\n' > packages/web/package.json\ngit add -A && git commit -qm init\n\"$bin\" init --yes --versioning independent --no-workflow >/dev/null 2>&1\ngit add -A && git commit -qm \"callisto init\"\necho \"=== add: typo'd package\"; \"$bin\" add --package cargo/libb:minor --summary \"x\" 2>&1 | head -12\necho \"=== add: bad severity\"; \"$bin\" add --package cargo/lib:huge --summary \"x\" 2>&1 | head -12\necho \"=== add: no ecosystem prefix\"; \"$bin\" add --package lib:minor --summary \"x\" 2>&1 | head -12\necho \"=== add: empty summary\"; \"$bin\" add --package cargo/lib:minor --summary \"\" 2>&1 | head -12\necho \"=== add: npm package\"; \"$bin\" add --package npm/@acme/web:patch --summary \"Fix the dev server restart.\" 2>&1 | head -6\necho \"=== status\"; \"$bin\" status 2>&1 | head -12\necho \"=== release --dry-run\"; \"$bin\" release --dry-run 2>&1 | head -25\necho \"=== version --dry-run\"; \"$bin\" version --dry-run 2>&1 | head -20\necho \"=== unknown command\"; \"$bin\" relase 2>&1 | head -8\necho \"dir: $d\"\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CrrLkgkEpLYFtNfuiGDFer","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sh /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/user_walk2.sh","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","hash":"f6fcd7ea2ca13910d9322fb0e79a3cdc3d22616cd9b02844a91027c1b0edcb69","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G3g8WeMpwsjWh8ApyvQJNL","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/user_walk2.sh (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CrrLkgkEpLYFtNfuiGDFer","type":"tool_result","content":"=== add: typo'd package\nE102\n\n  × package `cargo/libb` was not found in the workspace\n  help: Check the package's name and ecosystem, or that its directory has a\n        manifest callisto discovers.\n\n=== add: bad severity\nE271\n\n  × Invalid severity `huge`. Must be none, patch, minor, or major.\n  help: pass one of: none, patch, minor, major\n\n=== add: no ecosystem prefix\nE317\n\n  × --package: `lib` does not name its ecosystem\n  help: Write the ecosystem and name with a slash, such as `cargo/lib`, `npm/\n        lib` or `pypi/lib`.\n\n=== add: empty summary\nE275\n\n  × --summary cannot be empty\n  help: provide a non-empty description of the change\n\n=== add: npm package\nAdded changeset: .changeset/gentle-cobras-sprint.md\n=== status\nStatus:\n  npm/@acme/web 0.3.0 (pending: patch)\n  cargo/app 1.0.0 (pending: none)\n  cargo/lib 1.0.0 (pending: none)\n1 package(s) pending\n=== release --dry-run\nE323\n\n  × `cargo/app` has no description or license in its Cargo.toml, which\n  │ crates.io requires to publish\n  help: Add description or license to the package's Cargo.toml (or inherit it\n        from `[workspace.package]`), commit it, and run `callisto release`\n        again. Nothing has been published.\n\n=== version --dry-run\n[DRY-RUN] Version Plan Calculated (no files modified):\nVersion Plan:\n  npm/@acme/web 0.3.0 → 0.3.1\n=== unknown command\nerror: unrecognized subcommand 'relase'\n\n  tip: some similar subcommands exist: 'release-pr', 'release'\n\nUsage: callisto [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nFor more information, try '--help'.\ndir: /var/folders/q1/qkn6792j1c3cxt6vjd88tlc00000gn/T/tmp.Hs1lO0iuhY","is_error":false}]}}
