{"parentUuid":"ab8016d5-b5c9-4165-af99-6bbc8a899e09","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtXokJZ3FQznBLmEFgBK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_read_input_tokens":380361,"output_tokens":739,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":225},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2341,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":380361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2341},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5785,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"3bb366dd-7ea8-479f-86a3-6f68dead29ea","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgtXojzwaqUQqZG1jH6fh","requestRef":"c81b3e94-16b1-41ad-a175-79d25b99e08f","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a4815790-b9c5-4a0a-bfdb-8300234c69be","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:24:16.221Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"a4815790-b9c5-4a0a-bfdb-8300234c69be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtXokJZ3FQznBLmEFgBK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The error handling is strong, and I found one small gap worth a PR later. This was a read-only pass in a scratch repo, with no files changed.\n\n**What I tried and how it went**\n- **Unknown package** (`cargo/libb`): \"E102 package not found in the workspace\", with a hint to check the name and ecosystem.\n- **Bad severity, missing ecosystem, empty summary:** each gives a coded error with a concrete next step. For example, \"write the ecosystem and name with a slash, such as `cargo/lib`\".\n- **`release --dry-run` on a crate with no license or description:** a clear E323 pre-flight that says \"Nothing has been published\". A new user would otherwise find this out at publish time, so that's real value.\n- **Mistyped command** (`relase`): suggests `release` and `release-pr`.\n- **Scripted `add` for an npm package, `status`, `version --dry-run`:** all clear.\n\n**The gap.** For `cargo/libb`, E102 says the package wasn't found but doesn't say what you probably meant. In a monorepo with dozens of packages a typo is common, and the user has to run `status` to find the right name. A \"did you mean `cargo/lib`?\" line, or a short list of close matches, would turn a retry into a one-step fix. The change is small and self-contained.\n\nI'm not opening it yet, because #485 and #486 are still awaiting review. I'll start it as soon as one merges, so we keep to one open PR at a time.\n\nneeds input: review #485 and #486, or say if you'd rather I open the did-you-mean PR now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_read_input_tokens":380361,"output_tokens":739,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":225},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2341,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":380361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2341,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2341},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3bb366dd-7ea8-479f-86a3-6f68dead29ea","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgtXojzwaqUQqZG1jH6fh","requestRef":"c81b3e94-16b1-41ad-a175-79d25b99e08f","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3cb5af48-c911-4463-ad10-93fe4fd07205","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:24:16.224Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
