{"parentUuid":"0c2abcdf-df27-42ff-be2b-c98bc33e3a85","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguTf6ehRRhdMPBybzczQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_read_input_tokens":385788,"output_tokens":1544,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":759},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1544,"cache_read_input_tokens":385788,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":12152,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"0f5a70fe-eb64-4cc6-8b6c-4c07afe9f49b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguTf6EtbKVxHNGrsL9C3","requestRef":"73d9503a-aec5-4250-987a-b24bbb30c585","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"05640909-80f6-44d7-bf64-20945c044258","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:10:33.845Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"05640909-80f6-44d7-bf64-20945c044258","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguTf6ehRRhdMPBybzczQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 0.19.0 release is still running (not yet on GitHub Releases), so I can't confirm the publish yet. I'll report as soon as it finishes. On the trails, most of the 56 are stale bookkeeping and only a few are real work.\n\n**What the 56 are**\n- **Stale bookkeeping (about 35).** Their changes are merged and they were never closed:\n  - Auto-trails from old PRs (#40 to #148, #212 to #215).\n  - Release-PR trails (#71, #129, #163, #193, #256).\n  - Dependabot trails (#110, #111, #225, #226).\n- **Outcome trails with merged work (#233, #237, #245, #246, #176 and others).** They are likely done, but I haven't checked each one's done-when against the code. Don't trust \"likely done\" until we do.\n- **Real work remaining:** the few below.\n\n**What I'd do next, in order**\n1. **Check the first real release (#180's own done-when).** It says the first real release should show the draft-then-ready cycle. 0.19.0 is that release, so once it finishes I'll check the publish and the release PR cycle.\n2. **Private workspace root shows up as a package (#179).** Every npm monorepo with a private root that has a version lists it in `status` as a package, and `publish-to = [\"none\"]` doesn't hide it. The trail recommends an explicit `ignore = true` option on a package. That is real user value. It needs one decision from you: yes or no on that option.\n3. **Changelog checks in Callisto (#152).** Its done-when is to decide which checks Callisto should run on changeset summaries and where the rendered changelog is shown before merge. That's the exact question we just worked through, so it's half-decided. We now show the rendered body in the release PR; the open question is the soft lint.\n4. **Did-you-mean for a mistyped package name.** It's small and self-contained, from the walkthrough.\n5. **Read 0.18 and 0.19 timings for #247.** Its draft was waiting on 0.18.0 release timings, which we now have.\n\n**Housekeeping (needs your yes):** close the stale trails after a quick done-when check on the ones with merged work. I can produce the exact list.\n\nI'd start with 1 as soon as the release lands, then 2.\n\nneeds input: a yes or no on the `ignore = true` option for #179, and a go-ahead to close the stale trails."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_read_input_tokens":385788,"output_tokens":1544,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":759},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1544,"cache_read_input_tokens":385788,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6123,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6123},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0f5a70fe-eb64-4cc6-8b6c-4c07afe9f49b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguTf6EtbKVxHNGrsL9C3","requestRef":"73d9503a-aec5-4250-987a-b24bbb30c585","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd05a7ce-a58f-4d23-96a8-a9c423fd7a32","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:10:34.463Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
