{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:44:11.367Z","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","content":"Without extra work. Private mean no publishing, not just onto a private repo, no?"}
{"parentUuid":"18ae9972-a4b1-4611-a471-403d421d0c77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguWESum9JXYLSaWtCowy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":398472,"output_tokens":1209,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":638},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1209,"cache_read_input_tokens":398472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9853,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"f6b44509-6a97-4d64-81fc-efbe33653acb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguWESctkMoNn7KqdwTpx","requestRef":"bec1ab42-ff13-401f-aa8d-742b75e22f32","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"34f8af1e-6e60-4dce-b1a4-2d3b56e8bc68","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:44:17.359Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"34f8af1e-6e60-4dce-b1a4-2d3b56e8bc68","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguWESum9JXYLSaWtCowy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes for private workspace roots, no for private packages in general. This is my recommendation.\n\n**Private workspace roots: hide them.**\n- **What the spec says now:** WS-DISC-08 already hides a root `package.json` that is private and has no version, because it only holds `workspaces`.\n- **The gap:** the same container with a version, such as `\"version\": \"0.0.0\"`, is listed as a package, and `publish-to = [\"none\"]` doesn't hide it.\n- **The rule:** extend the existing one so a private root that declares `workspaces` is never discovered, with or without a version.\n- **Why no `ignore` key:** it needs no new config and nothing to learn. My earlier \"option B\" was more machinery than this problem needs.\n\n**The risk, and how I'd handle it.** Someone who deliberately versions a private root would see it vanish. `status` would print one line, such as \"ignored private workspace root `npm/monorepo`\", so it never vanishes silently. A root that is not private is unaffected.\n\n**Private packages in general: don't hide them.**\n- A private package is often versioned on purpose. If `app` depends on a private `lib`, a `lib` bump has to cascade to `app`.\n- Callisto's own `callisto-fixtures` is private and versioned with its fixed group.\n- Hiding all private packages would break cascades and groups.\n- The better fix for them is clarity: `release` and the release PR already show which packages actually publish.\n\n**Sequence.** Did-you-mean first, since it needs no decision. Then this change as one PR, with the spec text written first, then code and tests. I'd also update the #179 trail with this decision, since it replaces the trail's recommendation.\n\nneeds input: a go on this rule, and a go on closing the stale trails."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":398472,"output_tokens":1209,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":638},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1209,"cache_read_input_tokens":398472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":501},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f6b44509-6a97-4d64-81fc-efbe33653acb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguWESctkMoNn7KqdwTpx","requestRef":"bec1ab42-ff13-401f-aa8d-742b75e22f32","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"608788ca-ee8b-4173-90e4-16d9685a133e","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:44:17.365Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
