{"parentUuid":"746df9f7-5008-4ace-81c3-9f648fca3eba","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:WebSearch","toolUseID":"toolu_01Y23Htxgk8Hjaj4KyEVbcn2","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"unreleased-needs-tag\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"WebSearch\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/gabe/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.1.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":41},"type":"attachment","uuid":"721e5773-1a8d-4345-af39-ddc0eb03448d","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:45:17.330Z","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"73345d2d-89e7-4448-ad85-95466014b8b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5bd368-c9d8-4a9d-9f73-b1c8a7a184a6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SZt5chCRaKrCTNGENSyZ5i","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"release-please monorepo root package versioning \".\" component root package manifest when to version the root\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"release please action\",\"url\":\"https://docsearch.algolia.com/mcp/docs/repo/googleapis/release-please-action\"},{\"title\":\"release please manifest\",\"url\":\"https://equinor.github.io/ops-actions/workflows/release-please-manifest\"},{\"title\":\"home / skills / laurigates / claude-plugins / release-please-configuration\",\"url\":\"https://playbooks.com/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration\"},{\"title\":\"Sponsored byStartupDirs.com-Submit Your Startup to 300+ Directories in One Click\",\"url\":\"https://agentskills.so/skills/laurigates-claude-plugins-release-please-configuration\"},{\"title\":\"Sponsored byStartupDirs.com-Submit Your Startup to 300+ Directories in One Click\",\"url\":\"https://agentskills.so/zh/skills/laurigates-claude-plugins-release-please-configuration\"},{\"title\":\"The easiest way to debug your release-please\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/googleapis/release-please/blob/main/docs/troubleshooting.md\"},{\"title\":\"github-redirect.dependabot.com\",\"url\":\"https://github-redirect.dependabot.com/googleapis/release-please-action/issues/951\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google-github-actions/release-please-action/blob/45c32ccd248469ba2567c6dfd45c3c4cd2a241b4/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"release please action\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/googleapis/release-please-action\"},{\"title\":\"Agent Skills: Release-Please Configuration\",\"url\":\"https://agent-skills.md/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration\"},{\"title\":\"claudskills.com\",\"url\":\"https://claudskills.com/skills/release-please-configuration/SKILL.md\"},{\"title\":\"release please action\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/release-please-action\"},{\"title\":\"Release Please\",\"url\":\"https://www.skills.lc/rigerc/home-assistant-addons/rigerc-home-assistant-addons-claude-skills-release-please-skill-md\"},{\"title\":\"hscsec.cn\",\"url\":\"https://github.hscsec.cn/googleapis/release-please/blob/main/docs/design.md\"},{\"title\":\"release please configuration\",\"url\":\"https://claudeskills.info/zh-hant/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration/\"},{\"title\":\"skills release please\",\"url\":\"https://skillsmp.com/creators/bmad-labs/skills/skills-release-please\"},{\"title\":\"Release-Please Configuration\",\"url\":\"https://agent-skills.md/skills/adaptive-enforcement-lab/claude-skills/release-please-configuration\"}]\n\nThe search turned up the mechanics of a root package in release-please, but nothing that says when you should version it.\n\n- **Root package as an aggregate:** One community guide describes the root package \".\" as optional and as a way to combine all packages in the repository. Optionally, define a root package \".\" that combines all packages in your repository.\n- **Configuration shape:** In the config file, the root is keyed by \".\" in the `packages` map. For a single package at the root: { \"packages\": { \".\": { \"release-type\": \"node\" } } }. The manifest file uses the same key, with the root version stored under \".\" (\".release-please-manifest.json { \".\": \"1.0.0\" }).\n- **Action outputs:** The GitHub Action treats a component at path \".\" (or with no path set) as the root. If you have a root component (path is . or unset), then the action will also output: release_created, true if a root component release was created, false otherwise.\n- **Tagging:** Components in a monorepo get prefixed tags. The releases will use a component prefix for the release and tag like my-component-v1.2.3.\n\nThe search results do not cover when to version the root versus individual packages, or whether the root version should move independently. The official design and manifest docs would be the place to check that. I'd suggest searching for the release-please manifest releaser docs or the \"separate-pull-requests\" and \"linked-versions\" options.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"bde1eccb-2ea0-4d5e-85cc-f8bb83e718c0","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:45:17.564Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"release-please monorepo root package versioning \".\" component root package manifest when to version the root","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017eASDqLJZ7vvqg2N4Wd6A5","content":[{"title":"release please action","url":"https://docsearch.algolia.com/mcp/docs/repo/googleapis/release-please-action"},{"title":"release please manifest","url":"https://equinor.github.io/ops-actions/workflows/release-please-manifest"},{"title":"home / skills / laurigates / claude-plugins / release-please-configuration","url":"https://playbooks.com/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration"},{"title":"Sponsored byStartupDirs.com-Submit Your Startup to 300+ Directories in One Click","url":"https://agentskills.so/skills/laurigates-claude-plugins-release-please-configuration"},{"title":"Sponsored byStartupDirs.com-Submit Your Startup to 300+ Directories in One Click","url":"https://agentskills.so/zh/skills/laurigates-claude-plugins-release-please-configuration"},{"title":"The easiest way to debug your release-please","url":"https://github.com/googleapis/release-please/blob/main/docs/troubleshooting.md"},{"title":"github-redirect.dependabot.com","url":"https://github-redirect.dependabot.com/googleapis/release-please-action/issues/951"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/google-github-actions/release-please-action/blob/45c32ccd248469ba2567c6dfd45c3c4cd2a241b4/README.md"},{"title":"release please action","url":"https://github.com/googleapis/release-please-action"},{"title":"Agent Skills: Release-Please Configuration","url":"https://agent-skills.md/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration"},{"title":"claudskills.com","url":"https://claudskills.com/skills/release-please-configuration/SKILL.md"},{"title":"release please action","url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/release-please-action"},{"title":"Release Please","url":"https://www.skills.lc/rigerc/home-assistant-addons/rigerc-home-assistant-addons-claude-skills-release-please-skill-md"},{"title":"hscsec.cn","url":"https://github.hscsec.cn/googleapis/release-please/blob/main/docs/design.md"},{"title":"release please configuration","url":"https://claudeskills.info/zh-hant/skills/laurigates/claude-plugins/release-please-configuration/"},{"title":"skills release please","url":"https://skillsmp.com/creators/bmad-labs/skills/skills-release-please"},{"title":"Release-Please Configuration","url":"https://agent-skills.md/skills/adaptive-enforcement-lab/claude-skills/release-please-configuration"}]},"The search turned up the mechanics of a root package in release-please, but nothing that says when you should version it.\n\n- **Root package as an aggregate:** One community guide describes the root package \".\" as optional and as a way to combine all packages in the repository. Optionally, define a root package \".\" that combines all packages in your repository.\n- **Configuration shape:** In the config file, the root is keyed by \".\" in the `packages` map. For a single package at the root: { \"packages\": { \".\": { \"release-type\": \"node\" } } }. The manifest file uses the same key, with the root version stored under \".\" (\".release-please-manifest.json { \".\": \"1.0.0\" }).\n- **Action outputs:** The GitHub Action treats a component at path \".\" (or with no path set) as the root. If you have a root component (path is . or unset), then the action will also output: release_created, true if a root component release was created, false otherwise.\n- **Tagging:** Components in a monorepo get prefixed tags. The releases will use a component prefix for the release and tag like my-component-v1.2.3.\n\nThe search results do not cover when to version the root versus individual packages, or whether the root version should move independently. The official design and manifest docs would be the place to check that. I'd suggest searching for the release-please manifest releaser docs or the \"separate-pull-requests\" and \"linked-versions\" options."],"durationSeconds":5.571828874990344,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f87d275e-ef9d-4bcf-aaac-3e70dac1faca","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","branch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"73345d2d-89e7-4448-ad85-95466014b8b1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
