{"parentUuid":"b004624d-e903-4887-b287-f83760957e7e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguWKfVgwwTxEQkDfXJV7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4984,"cache_read_input_tokens":403375,"output_tokens":2134,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1089},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4984,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2134,"cache_read_input_tokens":403375,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4984,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4984},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13863,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"e8329f98-08b2-4850-a718-801276173e91","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguWKf2AMMQ35BhSofnxC","requestRef":"85c2a509-7bcc-4979-9938-4a732fcabb7a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e48f6e0e-730b-4625-a473-37b29be5325f","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:45:32.159Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"e48f6e0e-730b-4625-a473-37b29be5325f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguWKfVgwwTxEQkDfXJV7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The searches back the direction but didn't settle one thing: whether these tools skip a private workspace root by default. They did show how each handles the choice, and I'll mark what's confirmed and what isn't.\n\n**Confirmed by the sources**\n- **Changesets:** private packages are a setting, not an assumption. `privatePackages` takes `version` and `tag` flags, and setting it to `false` ignores private packages entirely. Per the results, `changeset init` writes both flags on, so by default private packages are versioned and tagged.\n- **Nx Release:** there's no default rule for private packages. You choose projects with a filter such as `[\"*\", \"!some-private-pkg\"]`, and the root can show up as a project.\n- **release-please:** the root is an explicit opt-in. You declare a root component under `\".\"` in the config, and without that entry it isn't versioned.\n\n**Not confirmed**\n- Whether Changesets, Lerna or Nx skip a private workspace root automatically. The results were thin (mostly aggregator pages), so I won't claim an industry default for that.\n\n**When there's a real need to version or publish a root.** From first principles:\n1. **The root is the product.** A single-package repo, or a repo whose root is the published library with `packages/` as internals. Then it is normally not private.\n2. **A repo-level version.** A version and changelog for the whole repo, which is what release-please's `\".\"` component represents. It's an explicit choice.\n3. **Nothing else.** A private root that only declares `workspaces` holds scripts and dev tooling, and there's no consumer for its version.\n\n**So my recommendation changes slightly.** Don't hide a private workspace root forever. Make it opt-in by name:\n- By default a private root with `workspaces` isn't discovered, whether or not it has a version.\n- Naming it in a `[[package]]` block brings it in. That matches release-please's explicit root, and a deliberately versioned root never silently vanishes.\n- `status` prints one line when it skips a root: \"ignored private workspace root `npm/monorepo` (name it in `[[package]]` to version it)\".\n- No `ignore` key and no new config surface.\n\nSources:\n- [Changesets: omit private packages from lists of changed and unchanged packages](https://lightrun.com/answers/changesets-changesets-omit-private-packages-from-lists-of-changed-and-unchanged-packages-offered-by-the-cli-when-running-)\n- [Changesets RFC: packages extensibility](https://lightrun.com/answers/changesets-changesets-rfc-packages-extensibility)\n- [Versioning and releasing packages in a monorepo (Nx)](https://nx.dev/blog/versioning-and-releasing-packages-in-a-monorepo)\n- [Nx Release: updating version references](https://nx.dev/docs/guides/nx-release/updating-version-references)\n- [release-please action](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please-action)\n- [release-please manifest](https://equinor.github.io/ops-actions/workflows/release-please-manifest)\n\nneeds input: a go on \"private workspace root is skipped unless named in `[[package]]`\", and a go on closing the stale trails."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4984,"cache_read_input_tokens":403375,"output_tokens":2134,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1089},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4984,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2134,"cache_read_input_tokens":403375,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4984,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4984},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e8329f98-08b2-4850-a718-801276173e91","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CguWKf2AMMQ35BhSofnxC","requestRef":"85c2a509-7bcc-4979-9938-4a732fcabb7a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a20690b3-278a-45e1-8ed7-adcf9c3f26a2","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:45:34.245Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
