{"parentUuid":"c974bd7c-cca3-406b-9953-00e1ad6673a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguWLyzDKxsL2XRKNweDw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. A private package is versioned but never published. That is how Callisto behaves today, and it matches the Changesets default.\n\n- **Versioned:** the package still gets a bump, a changelog section, and manifest updates for the packages that depend on it. In 0.19.0, `callisto-fixtures` went to 0.19.0 with its group.\n- **Not published:** it never appears in the \"Merging will publish\" table and gets no registry release. The 0.19.0 release published four crates, not five.\n\n**Where the root fits.** A private root that only declares `workspaces` is the one case where versioning has no point, because nothing depends on it and nobody consumes its version. So the model is:\n- **Private package:** versioned, not published.\n- **Private workspace root:** skipped by default, and versioned only if you name it in `[[package]]`.\n\nThat keeps the rule small, with no new config.\n\nneeds input: a go on the root rule, and a go on closing the stale trails."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2187,"cache_read_input_tokens":408359,"output_tokens":584,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":277},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2187,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":584,"cache_read_input_tokens":408359,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2187},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"351438