kspace.json WS-DISC-08 already says \"A root package.json that is both `private` and versionless is never discovered as an npm package (it only holds `workspaces`), regardless of admission.\" A root that is private, declares `workspaces`, and has a name AND a version (e.g. `{\"name\":\"monorepo\",\"private\":true,\"version\":\"0.0.0\",\"workspaces\":[\"packages/*\"]}`) is currently listed in `status` as `npm/monorepo 0.0.0`, and `[[package]] match = \"npm/monorepo\"` with `publish-to = [\"none\"]` does not hide it. Code to read: crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs (around line 141 and the tests near 640-730) and locate/root.rs. \"Private\" means never published to any registry, so such a root is a container for scripts and dev tooling, not a release unit, and nothing depends on it by version.\n\nRequired behavior:\n1. SPEC FIRST: edit WS-DISC-08 in docs/specs/workspace.json (keep it valid JSON) so a root package.json that is `private` and declares `workspaces` is not discovered as an npm package whether or not it has a version, unless a `[[package]]` block names it (then it is discovered as today). Write the spec text before the code, and keep the rest of the criterion intact.\n2. Tests first (fail before, pass after): private+workspaces+versioned root is not discovered; the same root named by a `[[package]]` block is discovered; a non-private root with workspaces is unaffected; a private root WITHOUT `workspaces` is unaffected (still discovered if it has a name and version); a private non-root workspace member is unaffected.\n3. `callisto status` (and any command that already prints discovery notes, like the existing note for a Cargo crate with no version) prints one note when it skips such a root: `ignored private workspace root \\`npm/monorepo\\` (name it in [[package]] to version it)`. Reuse the existing note mechanism; do not invent a new one. Add a test that the note appears.\n4. Update docs/config.md or docs/architecture/* only where they describe root discovery and would now be wrong.\n\nConstraints: no new config keys or flags. Smallest complete change. Match surrounding comment density; one short line only for a non-obvious why. Do NOT add a changeset file; instead return, in plain words, what a user now sees, why it helps and what to do if they did want the root versioned.\n\nVerify: `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, each judged by exit code. Mutation check: weaken the new rule and confirm a new test fails, then restore. Do NOT commit, push, or sign; leave changes uncommitted in your worktree. Final report: files changed, new test names, exact commands run with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a66cc14c58c4599d3.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4d96d84d-f790-4840-a80d-a35379c7ad95","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","branch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"73fa11f3-186b-4444-93c4-5357214ef5b0","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userT