{"parentUuid":"ae9ec1af-1b27-4a65-9266-7d9beb45a5a6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9de617ad-2afe-467a-aa03-57970496b3aa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012yquefxeLk62N1y2NtbGZm","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Async agent launched successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the agentId below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagentId: a68476f02ef165c79 (internal ID - do not mention to user. Use SendMessage with to: 'a68476f02ef165c79', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent.)\nThe agent is working in the background. You will be notified automatically when it completes. You know nothing about its results until that notification arrives — do not report, assume, or predict them; continue other work or respond to the user in the meantime.\nDo not duplicate this agent's work — avoid working with the same files or topics it is using.\noutput_file: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a68476f02ef165c79.output\nDo NOT Read or tail this file via the shell tool — it is the full subagent JSONL transcript and reading it will overflow your context. If the user asks for progress, say the agent is still running; you'll get a completion notification."}]}]},"uuid":"c780499b-e6da-40d2-8990-561028704598","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:53:37.398Z","toolUseResult":{"isAsync":true,"status":"async_launched","agentId":"a68476f02ef165c79","description":"Show versioned-not-published","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","prompt":"Task: the release PR should say which bumped packages are versioned but not published. Repo: Callisto (Rust release tool). Read AGENTS.md first and follow it.\n\nSetup: your worktree starts on an unrelated branch. First run `git switch -c feat/versioned-not-published origin/main` (the local origin/main ref is current; you cannot fetch). Work only here.\n\nContext: a private package (npm `private: true`, Cargo `publish = false`) is versioned (bumped, changelog, dependents updated) but never published. In release 0.19.0, `callisto-fixtures` (private) was bumped with its fixed group and appears in the release PR's package table next to the four crates that publish, and nothing says it publishes nowhere. The release PR's \"Merging will publish\" table (built in crates/callisto-graph/src/release_preview.rs by `publish_outlook_in`, rendered by `publish_section` in crates/callisto-graph/src/commands/pr_body.rs) already omits it, because `publish_outlook_in` plans only bumped packages that pass `has_dispatchable_target`. The bumped packages it leaves out are exactly the versioned-only ones.\n\nRequired behavior:\n1. `PublishOutlook::Planned` (or the closest existing structure) carries the display names of bumped packages with no publish target, as an OPTIONAL field with `#[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = ...)]` so existing preview files still load and `RELEASE_PREVIEW_SCHEMA_VERSION` stays the same. Add a test that an old preview JSON without the field still deserializes.\n2. `publish_outlook_in` fills it. Keep the selection and planning in that one function.\n3. `publish_section` renders one line after the publish table when the list is non-empty: `Versioned, not published: \\`callisto-fixtures\\` (no publish target).` Several names are comma-separated and each in backticks. Nothing is rendered when the list is empty. Follow the surrounding rendering style and the repo's emoji conventions (do not add new emoji; existing ones in the PR body are settled).\n4. The case where no bumped package publishes anywhere (currently an empty Planned plan): the line still appears, naming the versioned-only packages.\n5. Tests first (fail before, pass after): extend the existing end-to-end test `a_private_fixed_group_member_does_not_make_the_publish_plan_fail` in crates/callisto-cli/tests/emit_preview_tests.rs (or add a sibling) to assert the private member appears in the new field, and add a render test in pr_body.rs for the line (with names, with none).\n6. Update docs/architecture/versioning.md (the ReleasePreview bullet) and the relevant criterion in docs/specs/release.json (REL-PR-10 describes the publish section; keep valid JSON).\n\nConstraints: smallest complete change; no new flags or config. Match surrounding comment density; one short line only for a non-obvious why. Do NOT add a changeset file; instead return, in plain words, what a user now sees and why it helps.\n\nVerify: `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, each judged by exit code. Mutation check: stop filling the field and confirm the new tests fail, then restore. Do NOT commit, push, or sign; leave changes uncommitted in your worktree. Final report: files changed, new test names, exact commands run with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a68476f02ef165c79.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4d96d84d-f790-4840-a80d-a35379c7ad95","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","branch":"fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/unreleased-needs-tag","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ae9ec1af-