d\n180|merged=1 closed=1 open=0|The release PR says why it is held\n250|merged=19 closed=0 open=0|Release notes: structured model for the release PR and changelog\n162|merged=2 closed=0 open=0|A stale release PR can no longer wedge releases\n176|merged=2 closed=0 open=0|Release previews and preconditions work as specified\n152|merged=3 closed=0 open=0|Changelog entries read well for users\n233|merged=4 closed=0 open=0|Generated release workflows run in a downstream repo\n237|merged=5 closed=1 open=0|Cleanup: dead code, stale docs and narration\n198|merged=8 closed=0 open=0|Failures are loud and contracts are pinned to real output","is_error":false}]}}
