{"parentUuid":"3028cd0f-27a7-4184-a2c7-d0dcb01e7703","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguX7g3D4dnujhsTXaoMB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I closed the 26 bookkeeping trails, and 34 open trails remain on the first page of the listing. The three implementers are still running, and I'll review each result against its criteria before anything is pushed.\n\n**Trails closed:** old auto-trails from merged PRs (#40, #94, #117, #124, #139, #141 to #148, #212 to #215), the old release-PR trails (#71, #129, #163, #193, #256) and the Dependabot trails (#110, #111, #225, #226). Each had exactly one merged change and nothing open. Closing is reversible with `entire trail update N --status open`.\n\n**Left open on purpose**\n- **Outcome trails with all changes merged** (#173, #176, #177, #178, #233, #237, #245, #246, #198): I haven't checked each one's done-when yet, and I won't close them on a guess.\n- **Trails with explicit follow-ups:**\n  - #180: the first-real-release check.\n  - #247: the 0.18 and 0.19 timings.\n  - #162: its later plan steps.\n  - #152: the lint decision.\n  - #250: renderers and rollups still ahead.\n- **Planning trails with no changes yet** (#179, #194 to #197, #199): the real backlog.\n\n**While the implementers run, nothing else is in flight from me.** When each reports back, I'll:\n1. Check its diff against the criteria and read its test names.\n2. Run `verify.sh`, including the full `just workflow-contracts`.\n3. Do a pairwise overlap check across the three branches before pushing any.\n4. Draft each changeset in the layered shape, routed through the courier agent if the plugin update has landed, with a fresh-reader check.\n5. Sign, push, link each to its trail, and write each PR body.\n\nneeds input: none now. I'll report when the first implementer finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"c