{"parentUuid":"cef31127-b323-472c-986a-164b85b19b8a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguXo1Z4JD7WbZCobxDqT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NfV1UyQekrdp115d4qurKL","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79/.changeset/versioned-not-published.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nThe release PR says which packages are versioned but not published.\n\n- Under \"Merging will publish\", a line such as ``Versioned, not published: `callisto-fixtures` (no publish target).`` names each package that is bumped but has nowhere to publish, such as a private package that moves with its fixed group.\n- Before, that package sat in the package table next to the ones that publish, with nothing saying it goes nowhere.\n- For scripts: the `--emit-preview` file lists these packages as `versionedOnly` under `publish`.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1472,"cache_read_input_tokens":451448,"output_tokens":1230,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":610},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1472,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":451448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1472,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1472},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NfV1UyQekrdp115d4qurKL":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79/.changeset/versioned-not-published.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nThe release PR says which packages are versioned but not published.\n\n- Under \"Merging will publish\", a line such as ``Versioned, not published: `callisto-fixtures` (no publish target).`` names each package that is bumped but has nowhere to publish, such as a private package that moves with its fixed group.\n- Before, that package sat in the package table next to the ones that publish, with nothing saying it goes nowhere.\n- For scripts: the `--emit-preview` file lists these packages as `versionedOnly` under `publish`.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"4ada3bc5-4621-463d-90d1-35e22054b9eb","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CguXo1FhmjChzrWiRmogb","requestRef":"f2a2ed79-85b0-4fcc-8927-00d4ff65d5ec","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"607af940-1334-4c48-8691-b218056a656e","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:04:43.382Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"feat/versioned-not-published","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
