{"parentUuid":"7cf34d7b-fce2-4e3d-9d46-daa32d9dcedc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"de8735d6-9843-4dac-8c4f-e6565de8fbee","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K5Q89kmGrVMuZr1WyfSFf7","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3/.changeset/skip-private-workspace-root.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"b18de1a8-5bbb-4e14-b2ed-e41fabc2819f","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:07:15.405Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3/.changeset/skip-private-workspace-root.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nA private npm workspace root is no longer treated as a package.\n\n- A root `package.json` that is `private` and lists `workspaces` is skipped even when it has a version such as `0.0.0`, so it stops appearing in `status` and in release plans. It only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version.\n- `status` prints one line when it skips a root, so it never disappears silently.\n- To version the root anyway, name it in `callisto.toml` with a `[[package]]` block, for example `match = \"npm/monorepo\"`.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7cf34d7b-fce2-4e3d-9d46-daa32d9dcedc","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"feat/skip-private-root","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
