{"parentUuid":"d8aba489-bc4b-4bc0-bfac-3d1d120ee7f0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"de8735d6-9843-4dac-8c4f-e6565de8fbee","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013hmsM7PzbYYUqHaNUw4pLb","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3/.changeset/skip-private-workspace-root.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"6b950c32-ccb2-4037-8c42-709b48fce1a7","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:16:29.966Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3/.changeset/skip-private-workspace-root.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nA private npm workspace root is no longer treated as a package.\n\n- A root `package.json` that is `private` and lists `workspaces` is skipped, so it stops appearing in `status` and in release plans. Many project templates give that root a version such as `0.0.0`, and until now Callisto listed it as a package even though it only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version.\n- `status` prints one line when it skips a root, so it never disappears silently.\n- To version the root anyway, add a `[[package]]` block to `callisto.toml` with `match = \"npm/<name>\"`, where `<name>` is the root's `package.json` name, such as `match = \"npm/monorepo\"`.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":6,"newStart":4,"newLines":6,"lines":[" "," A private npm workspace root is no longer treated as a package."," ","-- A root `package.json` that is `private` and lists `workspaces` is skipped even when it has a version such as `0.0.0`, so it stops appearing in `status` and in release plans. It only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version.","+- A root `package.json` that is `private` and lists `workspaces` is skipped, so it stops appearing in `status` and in release plans. Many project templates give that root a version such as `0.0.0`, and until now Callisto listed it as a package even though it only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version."," - `status` prints one line when it skips a root, so it never disappears silently.","-- To version the root anyway, name it in `callisto.toml` with a `[[package]]` block, for example `match = \"npm/monorepo\"`.","+- To version the root anyway, add a `[[package]]` block to `callisto.toml` with `match = \"npm/<name>\"`, where `<name>` is the root's `package.json` name, such as `match = \"npm/monorepo\"`."]}],"originalFile":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nA private npm workspace root is no longer treated as a package.\n\n- A root `package.json` that is `private` and lists `workspaces` is skipped even when it has a version such as `0.0.0`, so it stops appearing in `status` and in release plans. It only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version.\n- `status` prints one line when it skips a root, so it never disappears silently.\n- To version the root anyway, name it in `callisto.toml` with a `[[package]]` block, for example `match = \"npm/monorepo\"`.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d8aba489-bc4b-4bc0-bfac-3d1d120ee7f0","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"feat/skip-private-root","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
