{"parentUuid":"77c7bab5-12df-4ecb-be0d-a2c50be21de3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguYjhg4cf4W8cYaSnqei","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BSst6nTG85p7J24Foc7iAD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79/.changeset/versioned-not-published.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nThe release PR says which packages are versioned but not published.\n\n- Under \"Merging will publish\", a line such as ``Versioned, not published: `callisto-fixtures` (no publish target).`` names each package that is bumped but has nowhere to publish, such as a private package that moves with its fixed group.\n- Before, that package sat in the package table next to the ones that publish, with nothing saying it goes nowhere.\n- For scripts: `--emit-preview` output adds `publish.versionedOnly`, listing those packages. It is a new optional field, so existing readers and older preview files keep working.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4297,"cache_read_input_tokens":507463,"output_tokens":480,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4297,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":480,"cache_read_input_tokens":507463,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4297,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4297},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01BSst6nTG85p7J24Foc7iAD":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c