{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","prNumber":487,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/487","prRepository":"orin-dx/callisto","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:17:18.635Z"}
{"parentUuid":"a60f9e2a-c084-42a2-8d2e-a1560766e674","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguYmFHMawTXGXpeUEpHx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The three PRs are ready for review, with bodies written by the courier agent and changesets fixed after a fresh reader's feedback.\n\n**Where they stand (all draft, signed, CI not yet run)**\n- **#487, versioned but not published.** Real run on this repo lists the four publishable crates, then `Versioned, not published: callisto-fixtures (no publish target).`\n- **#490, private workspace root.** Skipped unless a `[[package]]` block names it, and `status` prints one note.\n- **#491, did-you-mean.** A typo, a wrong ecosystem and an npm typo each suggest the right package, and a far miss is unchanged.\n\n**The fresh-reader check.** An agent with no context read the three changesets. It got what changed, why and the upgrade action right for all three. It raised three fair points, now fixed:\n- **Why a private root has a version:** the #490 entry now says many project templates give that root one, such as `0.0.0`.\n- **What `match` is:** the entry now says `match = \"npm/<name>\"`, where `<name>` is the root's `package.json` name.\n- **What `versionedOnly` means for scripts:** the #487 entry now says it is a new optional field, so existing readers keep working.\n\n**Housekeeping.** The three PR bodies came from the courier PR narrator, and the implementers were `smith:implementer` on Sonnet. I did not use Opus anywhere, since these were small, well-specified changes.\n\n**Still open from this batch.** The skip note in #490 prints on every command that loads the workspace, so `init` shows it more than once, the same as the existing Cargo \"no version\" note. A follow-up could dedupe both.\n\nI'll clean up the three implementer worktrees once the PRs merge, so I don't remove anything under review.\n\nneeds input: review #487, #490 and #491."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":880,"cache_read_input_tokens":511760,"output_tokens":595,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":511760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":880},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ab5d89d5-dca5-4671-a0b8-77e0bd6b8e5a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguYmEv3GdEbTvikLdwBb","requestRef":"5209199f-00b4-43d0-b8e8-ae8953e4a1e3","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"10b03036-9dfd-4ba5-9dad-942932d915cc","timestamp":"2026-11-10T16:17:22.917Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"feat/versioned-not-published","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
