{"parentUuid":"aa1d1b44-d9ce-479f-b93e-16f36c27d89b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgudmHAZAPjUtoqFnuV86","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The #490 failure is a runner problem, not a code problem, and I've re-queued the failed job.\n\n- **What failed:** `Release Artifact Preflight (macos-arm64)` shows `cancelled`, with no runner assigned and no steps run. It waited about 29 minutes for a `macos-arm64` machine and was cancelled.\n- **Evidence it isn't the change:** #487 failed the same way after 31 minutes, #491 passed the same job in under 4 minutes, and all 14 other jobs on #490 pass, including the tests on ubuntu and macOS.\n- **The other red check on #490:** Entire Gates fails because no reviewer has approved yet. That has nothing to do with code.\n- **What I did:** re-ran only the failed job on #490 and #487. I'll check the results and tell you if the runner is still stuck.\n\nIf `macos-arm64` keeps stalling, it is worth knowing before you rely on that job to gate merges, since it can fail a PR purely on runner supply.\n\nneeds input: none now. I'll report when the re-runs finish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":451,"cache_read_input_tokens":515827,"output_tokens":352,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":451,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":515827,"cache_creation_input_tokens":451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":451},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5ec6122e-b4fe