{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:24:54.629Z","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","content":"We have a code review finding for change #95: \n\n<pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/callisto-graph/src/release_preview.rs:54-55`\n\nThe enum’s `rename_all = \"camelCase\"` renames variants, not their fields, so this serializes as `versioned_only` instead of the documented `versionedOnly` (`docs/architecture/versioning.md:16`). A stored preview containing `\"versionedOnly\":[\"private-crate\"]` silently defaults this list to empty when loaded by `compose-pr-body --preview` (`crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/compose_pr_body.rs:36-49`), omitting the notice. Add an explicit `#[serde(rename = \"versionedOnly\")]` to the field.\n</pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">"}
