{"parentUuid":"d4e19fec-8c25-4144-8e9f-1467fb4efba7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgueHFHXfpZgvzhxhQnmE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The #95 finding on #487 was valid, and it's fixed and resolved. #492's merge conflict is also resolved and pushed.\n\n**Finding on #487.** `rename_all = \"camelCase\"` on the enum renames only the variants, so the new field was stored as `versioned_only`. A preview file with the documented `versionedOnly` key would have loaded as an empty list, and the notice would silently disappear.\n- **Fix:** one line, an explicit `rename = \"versionedOnly\"` on the field.\n- **Test:** a new test asserts the stored key and that a file with that key loads. It failed before the fix and passes now. All five local checks pass, and the commit is signed.\n- **Why I missed it:** my real run wrote and read the same wrong key, so it round-tripped fine. Only a test of the documented key could catch it. The changeset I wrote also claims `publish.versionedOnly`, which is now true.\n\n**One thing I noticed, not changing.** `ChangeKind::Commit` has a `short_sha` field, and the same `rename_all` rule means it's stored as `short_sha`, not camelCase. It shipped in 0.19.0, so renaming it is a format change for you to decide.\n\n**#492, your `chore/callisto-comment-guard`.** It conflicted in one file. Your branch had edited a test in `crates/callisto-cli/src/tty.rs` to satisfy the comment guard, and main (#488) had deleted that test. I took main's deletion. The five local checks pass, and your guard script `testing/check-comments.sh` exits 0 on the merged tree. I pushed it as a fast-forward of your branch (`cbcdbbe74..e826c382e`), so your local copy in `callisto-fixtures/wt-cleanup-3` needs a `git pull`. GitHub is still recomputing mergeability.\n\nneeds input: pull your local `chore/callisto-comment-guard`, and review #487, #490 and #491."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":534707,"output_tokens":642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":642,"cache_read_input_tokens":534707,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ebafeab9-5ff3-45e1-b66b-91f65a682fae","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgueHEwhWrZWwsgVCnFvj","requestRef":"cabe2f26-0fd2-4713-bf76-3439e531a456","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ec54e78-1c4c-48d6-ba55-31724c833889","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:29:44.379Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a68476f02ef165c79","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"feat/versioned-not-published","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
