{"parentUuid":"5d7030d4-0ae1-4990-9972-56d13742872b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgugooph1dNSE84Lf383R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #494 now has its description from the courier agent, and the earlier CI failures are cleared. The `macos-arm64` job I re-ran on #490 and #487 passed (2m21s and 3m14s), which confirms it was runner capacity.\n\n**Open PRs, all draft with signed commits, linked to trails**\n- **#487** versioned-but-not-published line, with the camelCase finding fixed and resolved.\n- **#490** private workspace root, skipped unless named.\n- **#491** did-you-mean for mistyped package names.\n- **#494** one git diff per tag commit instead of one per package: 151 diffs and 3.8 s down to 4 diffs and 1.0 s at 150 changed packages.\n- **#492** is yours (comment guard). I resolved its conflict and pushed.\n\nI haven't looked at CI results for #491, #492 or #494 beyond the one macOS job, so don't read \"CI passes\" from this.\n\n**Waiting on you**\n- Reviews on #487, #490, #491 and #494.\n- A `git pull` of your local `chore/callisto-comment-guard`, since I pushed a merge to it.\n- Your three calls: rename `short_sha` to camelCase in the preview file, close the changeset-lint trail #152 with \"no lint, process and plugin instead\", and add a \"Changelog\" line to the PR template.\n\n**Ready for me**\n- Check the done-when on the remaining outcome trails and close the finished ones.\n- Dedupe the repeated skip notes.\n- Remove the implementer worktrees once their PRs merge.\n\nneeds input: reviews, the pull, and the three calls."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":955,"cache_read_input_tokens":576798,"output_tokens":534,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":955,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":534,"cache_read_input_tokens":576798,"cache_creation_input_tokens":955,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":955},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"63541556-cb82-4838-a4fd-9cb9b11c23af","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgugooXaTisxPXVgA5aAt","requestRef":"295c1bd2-a392-4fdf-9149-c08cd92353b8","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e36d18d8-6b32-4e82-a42a-c64e20bf2559","timestamp":"2026-11-10T18:02:51.927Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aad7b373863f1de3f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"perf/batch-changed-files-pr","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
