{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","hash":"08172461c3b752813e7155e136ddcbfe80c6647b51c78c048bb4c60ec380d954","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now cleanup of the merged worktrees, each removed only if its tip is in `origin/main`. The live implementer's worktree and your `callisto-fixtures` worktrees stay."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019psKqXb5PnhXewNuDK7fME","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/clean_wt4.sh","content":"cd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process || exit 1\ngit fetch -q origin main\nbase=/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees\nfor pair in agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3:feat/skip-private-root agent-a68476f02ef165c79:feat/versioned-not-published agent-aad7b373863f1de3f:perf/batch-changed-files-pr agent-adba22f5917d499fe:feat/did-you-mean changeset-set:docs/changeset-set unreleased-needs-tag:fix/unreleased-needs-a-tag; do\n  dir=${pair%%:*}\n  br=${pair#*:}\n  if git merge-base --is-ancestor \"$br\" origin/main; then\n    git worktree remove --force \"$base/$dir\" && git branch -D \"$br\" >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"removed $dir ($br merged)\"\n  else\n    echo \"KEPT $dir: $br not in origin/main\"\n  fi\ndone\ngit worktree remove --force \"$base/comment-guard\" && echo \"removed comment-guard (detached)\"\nfor br in worktree-agent-a66cc14c58c4599d3 worktree-agent-a68476f02ef165c79 worktree-agent-aad7b373863f1de3f worktree-agent-adba22f5917d499fe; do git branch -D \"$br\" >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"deleted stray $br\"; done\ngit worktree list | cut -c1-110\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01422csT6PyMNPodjdD7vbnT","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sh /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/clean_wt4.sh; echo ---; cat .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md | head -40; grep -n \"Changesets:\" AGENTS.md","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
