{"parentUuid":"cdc6ef49-b6ef-4450-b58f-ae26fc242a65","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"742a1b36-e83f-484b-a2b0-adb3fe2a079e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FEDcssjCfpYaSUXbQJg6YS","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"b1eba62e-01e4-43fc-8334-68166c701362","timestamp":"2026-11-10T18:21:32.624Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md","oldString":"- [ ] Added a changeset (`callisto add`), or explain below why this change doesn't need one (docs-only, internal refactor with no observable behavior change)","newString":"- [ ] Added or updated the changeset for this feature (what a user sees, why it matters, what to do), or this change needs none: a fix to something unreleased, an internal change, tests or docs only. Say which below.","originalFile":"## Summary\n- What changed (1-3 bullets)\n- Why it was needed\n\n## Type of change\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] New feature\n- [ ] Breaking change (changes CLI flags, output format, or `callisto.toml` schema)\n- [ ] Documentation only\n\n## Changeset\n- [ ] Added a changeset (`callisto add`), or explain below why this change doesn't need one (docs-only, internal refactor with no observable behavior change)\n\n## Docs\n- [ ] A change to a flow, flag, config key or spec'd behavior updates the spec (`docs/specs/`), `ARCHITECTURE.md` or the matching `docs/architecture/` page, and `docs/config.md` / `docs/errors.md` where they apply, or says here why none applies\n\n## Test Plan\n- [ ] `just ci` passes locally (format, clippy, tests, WASM check, `cargo deny` audit)\n- [ ] Edge cases covered (e.g. malformed manifest, cyclic workspace dependency, WASM target)\n- [ ] Regression check against existing fixtures in `callisto-fixtures`\n\n## Related\nCloses #<issue>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":9,"oldLines":7,"newStart":9,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - [ ] Documentation only"," "," ## Changeset","-- [ ] Added a changeset (`callisto add`), or explain below why this change doesn't need one (docs-only, internal refactor with no observable behavior change)","+- [ ] Added or updated the changeset for this feature (what a user sees, why it matters, what to do), or this change needs none: a fix to something unreleased, an internal change, tests or docs only. Say which below."," "," ## Docs"," - [ ] A change to a flow, flag, config key or spec'd behavior updates the spec (`docs/specs/`), `ARCHITECTURE.md` or the matching `docs/architecture/` page, and `docs/config.md` / `docs/errors.md` where they apply, or says here why none applies"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cdc6ef49-b6ef-4450-b58f-ae26fc242a65","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/note-once","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
