{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","hash":"d3d2088193373cc49c6787796e7ff97905e1c6c4c7556ff4c6ec0283341e0a4c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Cleanup done: six merged worktrees, one detached worktree and four stray branches removed. Only the live implementer's worktree and yours remain. Now the changeset-process docs."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LB3NhxCTDzW8anvYNriH91","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process/AGENTS.md","old_string":"One changeset per user-visible topic. Lead with what the user sees now and say why it matters to them; add an action or limit when it matters. A fix to something not yet released has no changeset. Use a short sentence for a simple change, or a short lead and bullets for related details. No internal names, mechanism or filler.","new_string":"One changeset per user-visible outcome, written in the PR that makes it visible; a feature spanning several PRs gets its entry from the last one, and earlier PRs add none. Lead with what the user sees now and say why it matters to them; add an action or limit when it matters. Use a short sentence for a simple change, or a short lead with bullets and sub-bullets, in sections for upgrading, scripting or setup when there is enough to say. A fix to something not yet released, an internal change, and test-only or docs-only work have no changeset. Before review, have a reader with no context see only the changeset and say what changed, why it matters and what to do; read the rendered release PR before merging it. No internal names, mechanism or filler."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FEDcssjCfpYaSUXbQJg6YS","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md","old_string":"- [ ] Added a changeset (`callisto add`), or explain below why this change doesn't need one (docs-only, internal refactor with no observable behavior change)","new_string":"- [ ] Added or updated the changeset for this feature (what a user sees, why it matters, what to do), or this change needs none: a fix to something unreleased, an internal change, tests or docs only. Say which below."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ALDNX1rxV4gCtHWBBJcZXd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sh /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/verify.sh /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/changeset-process 2>&1 | grep -E \"PASS|FAIL\"","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
