{"parentUuid":"22a45291-5687-409f-b6c9-8bda8dd9be21","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguigxQut32oaNgXt1Xnz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cleanup is done, and two agents are still running. Here's the state, with no more waiting on you.\n\n**Done in this pass**\n- **Worktrees:** removed 6 merged worktrees, 1 detached worktree and 4 stray branches. Left in place are the live implementer's worktree and your `callisto-fixtures` ones.\n- **Trails closed (11):** #151, #159, #160, #169, #173, #233, #237, #245, #246, #247 and #152. Together with the 26 closed earlier, that's 37.\n- **Decisions recorded:** #152 (no changeset lint, and why) and #247 (0.19.0 released in about 13 minutes, down from 32). Entire refuses trail comments from Claude sessions, so I put both in the trail descriptions and didn't work around it.\n- **Trails kept open:** #162, #176, #177, #178, #180, #198 and #250, each with real work or an unconfirmed done-when.\n- **Docs PR #495:** the changeset process for AGENTS.md and the PR template (who writes it, when, and when none is needed). All five local checks pass, and it's linked to trail 152.\n\n**Your three calls, taken by default**\n- Closed #152 with the decision recorded.\n- Added the \"Changelog\" wording to the PR template, in #495.\n- Left `short_sha` unchanged, since renaming a shipped format is your decision.\n\n**Running now**\n- **pr495-body:** the courier agent writing #495's description.\n- **note-once:** the implementer that prints each discovery note once. I'll review it and run the checks when it reports, then open the PR.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll apply the #495 body and finish the notes PR as the agents report."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1033,"cache_read_input_tokens":606541,"output_tokens":685,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":125