{"parentUuid":"07f848fd-f052-4ff5-ba7a-60ff23046fc1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cguiz2mpPx1v6RmwJY49W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #496 is open for the print-once fix, and its description is being written. It's linked to trail 179, and all five local checks pass outside the sandbox. CI has not run.\n\n- **What it does:** each discovery note, ignored private root and crate with no version, now prints at most once per run. Before, `callisto init` printed the same note up to three times.\n- **Evidence:** a unit test on the helper, plus a CLI test that runs the real binary with `callisto init --yes` and asserts the note appears exactly once. Making the helper always print fails both tests, and the init test then shows three copies.\n- **Scope:** I left the release-preview note alone. It's a different kind of note, in the CLI crate.\n- **Changeset:** a short patch entry covering the user-visible repeat.\n\n**State of everything**\n- **Merged:** #487, #490, #491, #492, #494.\n- **Open and waiting on review:** #495 (changeset process docs) and #496 (this PR).\n- **Trails:** 37 closed in total. #162, #176, #177, #178, #180, #198 and #250 stay open with real work.\n\n**Still open for you, if you want it:** `short_sha` camelCase in the preview file, which is a shipped-format decision.\n\nI'll apply the #496 body when the narrator returns.\n\nneeds input: review #495 and #496."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":618350,"output_tokens":432,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":432,"cache_read_input_token