{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","id":"9e24b98d-a8a3-4762-a83c-f9e085853ef7","timestamp":"2026-11-10T18:31:52.544Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"d5585ec7e18514db30724a3c32e28e038ea6fd744902d2cb8a871da3fb8bff70","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"29e0e1f0-1704-4d6e-9691-1d24fabf2c9c","keep":1088,"tail":["ad29eafcf9d611606c0f7a0f0d0fecc8115daab30507c8e11940ddc58dc1fa4f","4e528e4bbb58779df70921d25b0fd2ab86f816ada15bd33619651aa102f5f198","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1090,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"100bc7ecc589e348994993163e863c50f038c977b5a34f36a04472b318822cf6"}
{"parentUuid":"c06d0a9e-7ae0-4c9c-9af8-34d8f374cbf6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cguj2S4bHLwDFtG1Jrno5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #496 now has its description. I kept the narrator's title and summary, then added the exact checks, the known limit that the guard is process-wide, and that CI hasn't run. A Haiku narrator was fine for this small change, but it left those out.\n\nNo agents are running now, and nothing else is waiting on me.\n\n**Open and waiting on review:** #495 (changeset process docs) and #496 (print each discovery note once).\n\n**Trail housekeeping:** 37 trails closed. The ones left open each have real work or an unconfirmed done-when: #162, #176, #177, #178, #180, #198 and #250.\n\n**What's next, if you want me to keep going without more decisions from you**\n1. **#177, JSON error envelope.** A failing `release plan` or `release-pr` subcommand reports a different `command` key and omits `dryRun`. Scripts that parse errors see inconsistent shapes. The trail has a clear plan.\n2. **#178, spec criteria without tests.** Seven named, test-only gaps with no code change. It's high safety value for low risk.\n3. **#176, release-command bugs.** Four spec mismatches in preview and error paths. I'd first check which of the four are already fixed.\n\nI'd take #177 and #178 in parallel with implementers, since they touch different areas, and verify each before opening the PRs.\n\nneeds input: review #495 and #496, and say \"go\" if you want me to start #177 and #178."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":817,"cache_read_input_tokens":620682,"output_tokens":464,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":817,"ephemeral_5m_input_token