n the current code for the known misses and pass after the fix. Cover at least: the release preview (all ChangeKind variants, PublishOutlook, Findings), the BumpReason variants inside version/status reports, the release receipt provider evidence variants, and operation role wire types.\n3. Update docs/specs and docs/architecture only where they name one of the old keys; keep spec JSON valid.\n4. Update the stored-file fixtures and tests that assert old keys.\n\nDo NOT add a changeset; instead return, in plain words, which JSON keys changed (old to new, and in which report or file) so I can judge whether it needs an upgrade note. Do not commit, push or sign. Verify with `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli -p callisto-model`, `just lint`, `just doc-check` judged by exit code, and a mutation check on the guard test (remove one rename and confirm it fails). Final report: the full list of fields changed, aliases decision, files changed, new test names, commands with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/a70a2dcb75857e08c.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c939dffa-0015-48d8-8687-14564f39336a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ae5865da7dc4349e3","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-ae5865da7dc4349e3","branch":"fix/note-once","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Proje