{"parentUuid":"ef70d550-600e-4095-9948-61149942d52d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgumLFoRyndmymiLKaoMp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XsD1DcHKeXNhaNSZ8aHYiB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr497.md","content":"## Summary\n\nAdds the one missing test from the spec-gaps trail: two cargo `[[release.artifact]]` entries on the same target triple come out of `callisto matrix` ordered by asset name, not declaration order (MX-OUT-02). The other six gaps on the trail already have tests on main, so nothing else changes.\n\n## Verify\n\nThe test runs the built binary with `tool-z.tar.gz` declared before `tool-a.tar.gz` and expects `tool-a.tar.gz` first. Removing the name tiebreak in `matrix.rs` fails it. `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":667529,"output_tokens":488,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":667529,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XsD1DcHKeXNhaNSZ8aHYiB":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr497.md","content":"## Summary\n\nAdds the one missing test from the spec-gaps trail: two cargo `[[release.artifact]]` entries on th