{"parentUuid":"01804786-abdc-4179-9c2a-4414dfd6a80c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgumLvh1sHmpdyhdBhhdV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Trail #178 is nearly done: six of its seven gaps were already covered on main, and PR #497 adds the seventh test. The full checks pass outside the sandbox, and the three failures the implementer saw were the sandbox.\n\n**#497 (test-only, no changeset):** `callisto matrix` orders two cargo artifacts on the same target triple by asset name, not declaration order. The test runs the built binary with `tool-z.tar.gz` declared before `tool-a.tar.gz`. Removing the name tiebreak in `matrix.rs` fails it. It's linked to trail 178, and CI has not run.\n\n**Thin spots the implementer flagged (it didn't change them):**\n- E101 is tested with `status` only, not `version`.\n- E007 doesn't assert the help text.\n- The unknown-package test checks for non-zero exit, not exactly 1.\n\nThese are small and could be one follow-up test PR. I'd only do it if the exit-code work below doesn't already cover the exact code.\n\n**Still running (4 agents)**\n- `error-envelope` (#177, plus the `release pending` envelope I added).\n- `camel-case-fields` (the JSON naming fix with its guard test).\n- `input-validation` (unknown keys in group tables, and `pre enter` tag validation).\n- `error-code-hygiene` (E171 and E111 meaning one condition each).\n\n**Waiting on the audit:** the rest of its report, from finding 7 onward.\n\n**Held until `error-envelope` lands:** exit codes. The audit found usage errors exit 1 instead of the promised 2, and it touches the same `main.rs` error path.\n\nneeds input: none. Please review #497. I'll report as the others finish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":667780,"output_tokens":561,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":645,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":561,"cache_read_input_tokens":667780,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":645},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"32fc34ab-b982-4079-ab53-692d780e1f55","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgumLvR9BtcmxiZ8XuL7a","requestRef":"865636ec-f1be-4276-8eb3-1efe8f44b7b7","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a4b8f726-6714-4095-8107-6be89bb10d29","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:02:21.525Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a2349442f816dc77a","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/error-code-hygiene","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
