{"parentUuid":"eb028276-ffab-4133-9ef6-45028d3727cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgumsR5QtcM3LxWxbT1et","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KD3d3o2ue2NA5LwY4rvtgn","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a70a2dcb75857e08c/.changeset/camel-case-json-fields.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nEvery JSON field Callisto writes is now camelCase, so scripts see one naming style.\n\n- `version` and `snapshot` `--format json` reports: `reason.dep_kind` and `reason.dependency_to` are now `depKind` and `dependencyTo`.\n- Release plumbing files: the preview's `short_sha` is `shortSha`, and the receipt's `peeled_commit`, `tag_name` and `byte_length` are `peeledCommit`, `tagName` and `byteLength`.\n- A test now walks every report and file type and fails on a snake_case key.\n\nBreaking: scripts that read `reason.dep_kind` or `reason.dependency_to` from `version` or `snapshot` JSON must use `depKind` and `dependencyTo`.\n\nAction: keep Callisto and the release action on one version. A release preview or receipt written by 0.19 does not load in this version.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10907,"cache_read_input_tokens":681189,"output_tokens":1144,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":485},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10907,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1144,"cache_read_input_tokens":681189,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10907},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":