{"parentUuid":"d8f3f12c-8384-47ca-aa88-6cd07c6ff4f6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"dbb1916f-3ada-4200-99b2-5de90a6bbb44","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01695vH8BsjGZ5RMu6ZZFyzY","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawned successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the ID below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagent_id: apr500-body-87021ebef9f8903f\nname: pr500-body\nThe agent is now running and will receive instructions via mailbox."}]}]},"uuid":"95ce97c5-ac6f-4e24-a905-e791b6ed0a23","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:18:26.249Z","toolUseResult":{"status":"teammate_spawned","prompt":"Write the title and body for a pull request in the Callisto repo (a release tool heading to 1.0). Read the diff at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr500.diff. Change: each error code now names one condition, because docs/stability.md says from 1.0 a code keeps its meaning. `callisto.toml`: E111 stays \"not valid TOML\" (syntax); an unknown key is now E325; a wrong-typed value or a missing required key is now E326 (a shared `parse_raw` in config/resolve.rs is used by both `config::load` and `init`). `release pending --from`: a value that is not a full 40-character SHA is E327 and a valid SHA that is not a release commit on this branch is E328; both used to report E171, which means \"internal release invariant violated, report it\". docs/errors.md updated. Compatibility cost: a script that matched E111 for an unknown key or wrong-type value, or E171 for a bad `--from`, stops matching; exit codes are unchanged. Not fixed, found by the sweep: E254 (\"unknown callisto key\") is a catch-all for several config conditions, and a few E171 sites in release/binding.rs and release/derive.rs look user-reachable through config but were not verified; both are follow-ups.\nVerified: six new tests drive the real binary (bad --from gives E327 or E328 not E171, syntax error E111, unknown key E325, wrong type E326, and every new code is documented); a mutation of the unknown-field detection fails the unknown-key test; `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI. Note: this conflicts with the input-validation PR only in adjacent rows of docs/errors.md.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 200 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body.","agentId":"apr500-body-87021ebef9f8903f","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","teammate_id":"pr500-body@session-6cc3e47b","agent_id":"apr500-body-87021ebef9f8903f","agent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr500-body","color":"purple","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"session-6cc3e47b","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8e8f2f41-d928-40fd-9570-69790c0c1f93","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","branch":"fix/input-validation","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d8f3f12c-8384-47ca-aa88-6cd07