{"parentUuid":"18b8c462-e65f-419b-8360-6bd8f8ab0b83","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgunazpKQcsqjboXEGgNe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SUAinSfSMZorja7UixCs5y","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr498_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`rename_all = \"camelCase\"` on an enum renames only variants, not the fields inside struct variants, so six JSON keys shipped as snake_case. The three affected enums now also carry `rename_all_fields = \"camelCase\"`. This lands before 1.0 because `docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` report shapes from 1.0, and a later rename would need a major version.\n\n## Breaking\n\nSix keys are renamed:\n\n- `reason.dep_kind` and `reason.dependency_to` in `version` and `snapshot` reports become `depKind` and `dependencyTo`.\n- `short_sha` in the release preview file becomes `shortSha`.\n- `peeled_commit`, `tag_name` and `byte_length` in the release receipt become `peeledCommit`, `tagName` and `byteLength`.\n\nNo serde aliases were added. The preview and receipt are CI-plumbing files tied to the exact Callisto version, and `BumpReason` is output-only. The changeset is minor, with Breaking and Action notes.\n\n## Verify\n\n- A new guard test fails on any snake_case key in the release preview, `BumpReason` inside version and snapshot reports, the release receipt, and operation roles. Removing each of the three attributes on its own makes it fail.\n- `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0.\n- Not run: CI.\n- Not covered by the guard: `MatrixReport`, `ReleasePr*`, and the decision and intent types. These were checked only by a derive scan.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2302,"cache_read_input_tokens":742650,"output_tokens":1567,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":78},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2302,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1567,"cache_read_input_tokens":742650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2302},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01SUAinSfSMZorja7UixCs5y":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr498_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`rename_all = \"camelCase\"` on an enum renames only variants, not the fields inside struct variants, so six JSON keys shipped as snake_case. The three affected enums now also carry `rename_all_fields = \"camelCase\"`. This lands before 1.0 because `docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` report shapes from 1.0, and a later rename would need a major version.\n\n## Breaking\n\nSix keys are renamed:\n\n- `reason.dep_kind` and `reason.dependency_to` in `version` and `snapshot` reports become `depKind` and `dependencyTo`.\n- `short_sha` in the release preview file becomes `shortSha`.\n- `peeled_commit`, `tag_name` and `byte_length` in the release receipt become `peeledCommit`, `tagName` and `byteLength`.\n\nNo serde aliases were added. The preview and receipt are CI-plumbing files tied to the exact Callisto version, and `BumpReason` is output-only. The changeset is minor, with Breaking and Action notes.\n\n## Verify\n\n- A new guard test fails on any snake_case key in the release preview, `BumpReason` inside version and snapshot reports, the release receipt, and operation roles. Removing each of the three attributes on its own makes it fail.\n- `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0.\n- Not run: CI.\n- Not covered by the guard: `MatrixReport`, `ReleasePr*`, and the decision and intent types. These were checked only by a derive scan.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b2e160e9-6b8a-4d91-a621-92ec4b18df66","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgunazH5TEksoU8kZDm23","requestRef":"a3c258ee-65a1-481e-8adc-af03180e2f6c","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b5012be-b8af-433d-9e4e-ccf9937afb62","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:18:39.111Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
