ked only by a derive scan.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5b5012be-b8af-433d-9e4e-ccf9937afb62","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"13ca79a3-33bf-4203-bfd1-235c4a26b837","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Write","toolUseID":"toolu_01SUAinSfSMZorja7UixCs5y","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"terminalSequence\":\"\\u001b]777;notify;warp://cli-agent;{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"tool_complete\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"agent-a99fea3d03893e29f\\\",\\\"tool_name\\\":\\\"Write\\\"}\\u0007\"}\n","stderr":"/Users/gabe/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-code-warp/warp/2.1.0/scripts/emit-terminal-sequence.sh: line 82: /dev/tty: Device not configured\n","exitCode":0,"command":"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/on-post-tool-use.sh","durationMs":36},"type":"attachment","uuid":"55f95b04-83d7-43b6-a8ff-d1ded604f148","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:18:39.265Z","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"55f95b04-83d7-43b6-a8ff-d1ded604f148","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgunazpKQcsqjboXEGgNe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GBahqXqdScCmX73edNiacz","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr501_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\nTwo input-validation gaps found by the pre-1.0 audit of `docs/stability.md`.\n\n`[[fixed-group]]` and `[[linked-group]]` silently accepted unknown keys, so a typo'd key was ignored. Every other table already rejected them. Both group tables now reject unknown keys.\n\n`callisto pre enter \"bad tag!\"` succeeded and wrote `pre.json`, and the next `version` failed with a confusing SemVer error. `pre enter` now validates its tag with the same validator as `snapshot --tag` (one `validate_tag`, E324, variant renamed `TagInvalid`) and writes nothing on failure. `pre enter` still allows dotted identifiers such as `beta.1` and `rc.2`, which are valid SemVer, while `snapshot --tag` stays single-identifier. An empty tag keeps its existing E279.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nA config with a stray key in a group block now fails to load. No previously valid pre tag is rejected.\n\n## Verify\n\nA table-driven test puts a typo'd key in each of the 12 config tables and asserts each is rejected naming the key. Removing `deny_unknown_fields` fails it, and so does applying the strict single-identifier rule at `pre enter`. `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run.\n\nThis touches adjacent rows of `docs/errors.md` with the error-code PR (#500), so expect a trivial conflict.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2302,"cache_read_input_tokens":742650,"output_tokens":1567,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":78},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2302,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1567,"cache_read_input_tokens":742650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2302},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01GBahqXqdScCmX73edNiacz":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr501_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\nTwo input-validation gaps found by the pre-1.0 audit of `docs/stability.md`.\n\n`[[fixed-group]]` and `[[linked-group]]` silently accepted unknown keys, so a typo'd key was ignored. Every other table already rejected them. Both group tables now reject unknown keys.\n\n`callisto pre enter \"bad tag!\"` succeeded and wrote `pre.json`, and the next `version` failed with a confusing SemVer error. `pre enter` now validates its tag with the same validator as `snapshot --tag` (one `validate_tag`, E324, variant renamed `TagInvalid`) and writes nothing on failure. `pre enter` still allows dotted identifiers such as `beta.1` and `rc.2`, which are valid SemVer, while `snapshot --tag` stays single-identifier. An empty tag keeps its existing E279.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nA config with a stray key in a group block now fails to load. No previously valid pre tag is rejected.\n\n## Verify\n\nA table-driven test puts a typo'd key in each of the 12 config tables and asserts each is rejected naming the key. Removing `deny_unknown_fields` fails it, and so does applying the strict single-identifier rule at `pre enter`. `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run.\n\nThis touches adjacent rows of `docs/errors.md` with the error-code PR (#500), so expect a trivial conflict.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b2e160e9-6b8a-4d91-a621-92ec4b18df66","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgunazH5TEksoU8kZDm23","requestRef":"a3c258ee-65a1-481e-8adc-af03180e2f6c","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bbcafadf-e34d-41cd-a4ab-aed869f38629","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:18:41.878Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
