ase/derive.rs` look reachable through config but were not verified.\n\nThis overlaps the input-validation PR (#501) only in adjacent rows of `docs/errors.md`.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ade8f867-7a56-4e49-b79a-66e2f9177265","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
