{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":8710,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"17495e95-ab82-4a9b-86fc-8a66604749c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguoF5fpmkdEJeTkj74ok","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both are launched, and I'm acting on your two approvals.\n\n**Running in parallel**\n- **`exit-code-2`:** classifies every error code as usage-class (exit 2) or runtime (exit 1) in one function. A test fails when a new code is left unclassified, so the decision can't be forgotten later. It reports the full classification per code, and I'll check each borderline call.\n- **`cli-polish`** does five small items:\n  - Reject duplicate packages in `add` (today it writes a changeset its own reader rejects).\n  - Correct the `snapshot --strict` help text.\n  - Make `status` print `lastTag: null` like `lastReleasedVersion`.\n  - Document that `version_command` can't take quoted arguments.\n  - Reword the Changesets row in `docs/stability.md` to say it's the bare name unless ambiguous, which is the bare-names decision you approved.\n\n**What I'll do when they report**\n- Review against the criteria, run the full checks outside the sandbox, and check overlap with the open PRs. Exit-2 touches `main.rs`, so it's the one most likely to conflict with #499.\n- Write each changeset with a clear upgrade note. Exit-2 is a real behavior change: a script checking `$? -eq 1` after a bad flag value would see 2.\n\n**Still waiting on you:** reviews on #498 to #501, with #500 merging before #501.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll report as each agent finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7250,"cache_read_input_tokens":751346,"output_tokens":478,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7250,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":478,"cache_read_input_tokens":751346,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7250},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"42f5a3a4-aa71-4325-b6a2-d54d092eb9b9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguoF5LEyb2tKBwTEDqoG","requestRef":"5bb722fe-6511-4b20-92c9-b4f7ef91c830","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc38cb33-1a71-461d-ba5c-03aab56ae309","timestamp":"2026-11-10T19:27:15.511Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a99fea3d03893e29f","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/input-validation","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
